But converting all to non-indexed increases vertex count ~ slightly but acceptable. Yet for big batches maybe memory heavy but okay. Could instead ensure non-indexed geometries get index? There's no built-in toIndex for polyhedron, but mergeGeometries with non-indexed all is fine.

